   "question":"A shopkeeper offers a discount of 15% on the marked price of a product. If the marked price is $120, what is the selling price after the discount?",
   "options":["$102","$108","$114","$120"],
   "answerIndex":0,
   "explanation":"Discount is 15% of $120, which is $18. So, selling price is $120 - $18 = $102."
